Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: WSA: follow Golden v33 per-pair VI clock order

Start TX0/1, materialize TOP_CFG1, then do TX2/3 and materialize
again. Check the paired PA/mute epoch each time and roll back all
four lanes on any failure. No caller or DT enable is added.

